## Commands

- `uv run build.py all` regenerates results and the paper; run it after changing data, scripts, or
  notebooks. Single stages: `prepare`, `analyze`, `paper`, `check`.
- Notebooks write paper inputs only through `notebooks/paper_outputs.py`. Never type a result
  number into the paper; use `{{< var id >}}`.

